3:14 | E4 .6
4:00 | D4:12 .75
5:04 | E4 .7
5:06 | E4 .6
5:08 | G4 .8
5:10 | C5:10 .9       # call reaches higher
6:04 | B4 .65
6:06 | A4 .6
6:08 | F4:6 .75
6:14 | E4 .6
