2:00 | B4:4 .7
2:04 | G4:4 .6
3:00 | E5:8 .7          # hook answered, resolves to the 9th
3:08 | D5:24 .6

# ---------------- pluck ----------------
pattern p_intro 4x16 pluck      # the hook, foreshadowed
1:00 | C5:3 .7
1:06 | C5 .55
1:08 | D5 .65
1:10 | C5:3 .6
2:00 | B4:3 .6
2:04 | G4:3 .5
2:08 | D5:4 .7
3:00 | C5:3 .7
3:06 | C5 .55
3:08 | D5 .65
3:10 | C5:3 .6
4:00 | B4:3 .6
4:04 | G4:3 .5
4:08 | D5:4 .7
4:12 | E5 .6
4:14 | D5 .5

pattern p_arp 16 pluck
00 | t1+12:1 .55
03 | t3+12:1 .45
06 | t1+24:1 .5
08 | t2+12:1 .45
11 | t3+12:1 .45
14 | t2+24:1 .4

pattern p_counter 8x16 pluck    # chorus 2: answers in the gaps of the hook
1:12 | A5:2 .6
1:14 | G5:2 .5
2:12 | G5:4 .55
3:12 | B5:2 .5
3:14 | G5:2 .5
4:08 | E5:2 .5
4:10 | A5:4 .6
5:12 | A5:2 .6
5:14 | G5:2 .5
6:00 | B5:6 .55
7:04 | G5:2 .6
7:06 | A5:2 .5
7:12 | G5:2 .6
7:14 | E5:2 .5
8:00 | G5:8 .55
8:08 | E5:4 .5

# ---------------- drums ----------------
pattern d_intro 16 kick
lane kick  x... .... x... ....

pattern d_verse 16 kick snare hat
lane kick  x... .... x.x. ....
lane snare .... 7... .... 7...
lane hat   6.3. 5.3. 6.3. 5.3.

pattern d_verse2 16 kick snare hat
lane kick  x... ...x x.x. ....
lane snare .... 7... .... 7..2
lane hat   6343 5343 6343 5343

pattern d_pre 16 kick snare hat
lane kick  x... x... x... x...
lane snare .... 7... .... 7...
lane hat   ..5. ..5. ..5. ..5.

pattern d_chorus 16 kick snare hat
lane kick  x... ..x. x... .x..
lane snare .... 9... .... 9...
lane hat   7454 6454 7454 6454

pattern d_bridge_a 16 hat
lane hat   4... .... 3... ....

pattern d_bridge_b 16 kick hat
lane kick  x... x... x... x...
lane hat   ..4. ..4. ..4. ..4.

pattern fill 16 kick snare hat      # last bar before every chorus
lane kick  x... .... x... ....
lane snare 3.3. 4.4. 5656 7899
lane hat   0... .... .... ....

pattern d_outro 16 kick hat
lane kick  x... .... .... ....
lane hat   5... .... .... ....

# ---------------- crash, open hat, toms ----------------
pattern pre_p 4x16 crash tomhi tomlo
4:08 | . | x .6 | .
4:10 | . | x .7 | .
4:12 | . | .    | x .8
4:14 | . | .    | x .9

pattern ch_p 8x16 crash
1:00 | x 1
5:00 | x .7

pattern oh 16 ohat
lane ohat ..5. ..5. ..5. ..5.

pattern verse_p 8x16 crash
1:00 | x .6

pattern out_p 4x16 crash
1:00 | x .9

# ---------------- form ----------------
section intro    h_verse+p_intro+d_intro
section verse    l_verse1+h_verse+b_verse+d_verse+verse_p
section verse2   l_verse2+h_verse+b_eighth+d_verse2+p_arp+verse_p
section pre      h_pre+l_pre+b_eighth+d_pre+pre_p+fill@4:00
section chorus   l_chorus+h_chorus+b_eighth+d_chorus+ch_p+oh
section chorus2  l_chorus+h_chorus+b_eighth+d_chorus+p_counter+ch_p+oh
section bridge_a h_bridge+l_br1+b_break+d_bridge_a
section bridge_b h_bridge+l_br2+b_verse+d_bridge_b+pre_p+fill@4:00
section outro    h_outro+l_outro+b_break+d_outro+out_p

order intro verse pre chorus
order verse2 pre chorus2
order bridge_a bridge_b
order chorus2 chorus2^2
order outro
